        "description": "__Position:__ Grand Inquisitor (Supreme Torturer)\n__Favorite Food:__ Sake, Wine, Squid Shiokara, Anchovies, and Chocolate.\n__Special Skills:__ \"Torture\" with good, sewing.\n\nShe was scouted to join Hellhorde after they witnessed her reaction to delicious food at a restaurant. She always visits her parents during every holiday. Her younger sister and her sister's husband live at her parents' house, so Torture has been telling them to just clear out and repurpose her old room. But if they actually went through with it, she'd secretly miss it.",
