        "description": "**Favorite Food:** Beer, plum wine, mayonnaise, and curry.\n\nHe is the most powerful and invincible three-eyed monster, standing at the pinnacle of all demons. He has a terrifying, charismatic presence and a dignified appearance, but his true face is that of a doting father who dotes on his only daughter, [Maomao](https://anilist.co/character/151038/Maomao). He also has an otaku side, such as following voice actors and watching Sunday morning TV shows.",
