        "description": "__Position:__ Harm-Marshal (Senior Tourturer)\n__Favorite Food:__  Roast Beef, Scones.\n__Special Skills:__ Daughter of the illustrious Peschutz line. Excels at everything (self-proclaimed.) Good at needle felting to make small mascots (according to her parents.)\n\nThe Vampire Clan has been around for a long time. Nowadays they don't suck blood directly but instead eat foods rich in iron for nourishment. Their clan is sensitive to the sun. If they spend a long time in sunshine, their skin will get red and irritated the next day.",
