        "description": "**Favorite Food:** Sweets and snacks.\n\nHe is an \"honorary knight\" who has served the kingdom for many years and been awarded medals for his numerous military achievements. After retiring, he serves the kingdom as a butler and is tasked with keeping a strict watch over the princess, but he has a bit of a soft spot for her, secretly buying her sweets on the way home from lessons or making detours to Chinese restaurants.",
